+// tout indiqué SON joueur et aucun autre"). After its loop over the racers, the HUD task (0x8041DD78)
+// draws a block for racer 0 written in the code (r22, 0x8041EE00), skipped once racer 0 has crossed the
+// line (+0xBA8 & 0x80000): on the other machines the time, rank and speed went away at racer 0's finish.
+// The block only reads its racer (+0xBA8, +0xBAC, +0x624, +0x5E6, +0xBC, +0x1034). And the task
+// 0x804250C0 (made at the race's start, 0x8043825C) reads racer 0 the same way (r20, 0x8042653C: +0x9D4,
+// +0xBA8, +0x102E, +0x1029, +0xBC, +0xBA). Written: the seat's racer in place of racer 0.
+constexpr std::uint32_t SeatRacerLow(int seat)
+{
+  return (0x9440u + 0x1080u * static_cast<std::uint32_t>(seat)) & 0xFFFFu;
+}
