+// state 5: three alphas from 255 to 0, measured in RAM dumps of Knuckles's machine before and after) once
+// racer 0, written in the code (0x804309C4, r4), has crossed the line. Written: the seat's racer.
+SeatDisplay s_hud_fade{"HUD fade at the finish (0x804309C4)",
+                       {{0x804309C4, 0x38849440}},  // addi r4, r4, -0x6BC0 (racer 0)
